# backslash-comment-blank: Does a comment backslash followed by a blank line leave the line after the blank intact (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: v@3=1
# pc: ok
# ruling: the blank line is the one swallowed, so `x'=1` survives. Nothing the author wrote is lost, so PhaseCont gives no warning (language.md, Lines).
# a note \

x'=1
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
